  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/szd6rGi.png\" width=\"1200\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<strong>美酒與典雅裝潢<br></strong></span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">開啟 Let's Do 系列之作</span></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">「生命，輕柔壓榨」</span></em></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">Vinery 添加了全新方式，透過直觀的機制來釀造奢華飲品。你採收葡萄藤、壓榨葡萄、發酵葡萄酒，而時間會為你陳釀。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">盡情發酵你想要的葡萄酒。珍惜時光。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">Vinery 是開啟 Let's Do 系列的模組，旨在拓展藥水效果與奢華飲品的世界。從此不再只有簡單的水和蜂蜜！</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>採收葡萄藤</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在世界各處發現多種野生葡萄</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可裝飾你葡萄園的藤蔓莖</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">新的櫻桃樹，能產出真正的櫻桃<br></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">拿起你的籃子，掃蕩葡萄園吧。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">發酵完美</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">葡萄壓榨盆來壓榨葡萄</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">發酵桶將葡萄汁發酵成葡萄酒</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">蘋果壓榨器將蘋果搗碎成蘋果汁</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">壓榨、發酵、陳釀，這就是生命的藤蔓。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">裝飾元素</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li>葡萄園的格架</li>\n<li>小屋的家具</li>\n<li>全新的櫻桃木</li>\n<li>符合身份的釀酒師裝束</li>\n<li>展示你頂級佳釀的陳列架</li>\n<li>還有我們一直想要的土質半磚 ;)</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>種瓜得瓜。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>付出努力。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>珍惜每一刻。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>獻給 MissLilitu</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Let’s Do 系列</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flets-do.ch%252fmods%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Let-s-Do-Collection/Let-s-Do-Collection/raw/main/LOGO.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Let’s Do 系列\"></a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">支持與社群</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">Let’s Do 透過社群成長茁壯。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Let-s-Do-Collection/Let-s-Do-Collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> • <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Jb2bgpYr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> • <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/u78595058\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fletsdo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/ba492f31-afa4-43bd-b651-f1e2ea1f340b.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
